<!DOCTYPE html>
<!-- ERP Comercial | GitHub-ready PHP + SQLite version. Frontend entrypoint: public/index.php -->
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>ERP Comercial</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #ffffff;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --surface-2: #f8fafc;
      --surface-3: #f1f5f9;
      --text: #111827;
      --muted: #64748b;
      --line: #e2e8f0;
      --line-2: #cbd5e1;
      --brand: #0f6fbf;
      --brand-2: #04a7c4;
      --success: #16a34a;
      --warning: #d97706;
      --danger: #dc2626;
      --violet: #7c3aed;
      --dark: #111827;
      --yellow: #eab308;
      --red: #c62828;
      --radius: 18px;
      --shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(15, 23, 42, .08);
      --shadow-soft: 0 8px 25px rgba(15, 23, 42, .06);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--text);
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    button, input, select, textarea { font: inherit; }
    button { user-select: none; }
    img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }
    .hidden { display: none !important; }

    .app {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 292px 1fr;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .sidebar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      height: 100vh;
      padding: 20px 18px;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: #fff;
      overflow-y: auto;
      z-index: 30;
    }

    .corporate-logo {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 12px;
      background: #fff;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .corporate-logo img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 170px;
      object-fit: contain;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff, #f8fafc);
      border-radius: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), var(--brand-2));
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -.03em;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(15,111,191,.18);
    }

    .brand h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.08;
      letter-spacing: -.02em;
    }

    .brand small {
      display: block;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-top: 3px;
    }

    .nav-title {
      margin: 18px 6px 8px;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .13em;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .nav button {
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 11px 12px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      background: transparent;
      color: #334155;
      text-align: left;
      border-radius: 13px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: .16s ease;
    }

    .nav button:hover {
      background: var(--surface-2);
      border-color: var(--line);
    }

    .nav button.active {
      background: #eff6ff;
      border-color: #bfdbfe;
      color: #1d4ed8;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .nav button span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .side-card {
      margin-top: 16px;
      padding: 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: var(--surface-2);
    }

    .side-card strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .side-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    main {
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 24px 28px 40px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 88% 0%, rgba(14, 165, 233, .08), transparent 28%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #ffffff 48%, #f8fafc 100%);
    }

    .hero {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      gap: 22px;
      align-items: start;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .title h2 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: clamp(25px, 3vw, 40px);
      letter-spacing: -.045em;
      line-height: .98;
      color: #0f172a;
    }

    .title p {
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 980px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .logo-strip {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 120px);
      gap: 10px;
      justify-content: end;
    }

    .logo-tile {
      height: 66px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 15px;
      background: #fff;
      padding: 8px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
    }

    .logo-tile img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: contain;
    }

    .toolbar {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .filters {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 220px 160px 160px 180px;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: end;
    }

    .actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 9px;
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }

    .btn {
      border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
      background: #fff;
      color: #0f172a;
      padding: 10px 13px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: .16s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(15,23,42,.04);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      white-space: nowrap;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      border-color: #94a3b8;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(15,23,42,.08);
    }

    .btn.primary {
      color: #fff;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), var(--brand-2));
      border-color: transparent;
    }

    .btn.success {
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--success);
      border-color: var(--success);
    }

    .btn.danger {
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--danger);
      border-color: var(--danger);
    }

    .btn.soft {
      background: #eff6ff;
      border-color: #bfdbfe;
      color: #1d4ed8;
    }

    .field {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    label {
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .09em;
      color: #64748b;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    input, select, textarea {
      width: 100%;
      border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
      background: #fff;
      color: #0f172a;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 10px 11px;
      outline: none;
      transition: .15s ease;
    }

    input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {
      border-color: #60a5fa;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(59,130,246,.12);
    }

    textarea {
      min-height: 84px;
      resize: vertical;
    }

    .section {
      display: none;
      animation: fadeIn .18s ease;
    }

    .section.active { display: block; }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: .4; transform: translateY(5px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .grid.cards {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .grid.two {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, .9fr);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .grid.three {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .card {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .card-header {
      padding: 17px 18px 0;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .card-header h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #0f172a;
      letter-spacing: -.01em;
    }

    .card-header p {
      margin: 5px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.45;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .card-body {
      padding: 18px;
    }

    .kpi {
      padding: 18px;
      position: relative;
      min-height: 148px;
    }

    .kpi .label {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .09em;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .kpi .value {
      margin-top: 11px;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 29px;
      font-weight: 950;
      letter-spacing: -.045em;
      line-height: 1.02;
    }

    .kpi .sub {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .kpi .badge {
      position: absolute;
      right: 14px;
      top: 14px;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 5px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #475569;
      background: #f8fafc;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .badge.success { color: #166534; background: #dcfce7; border-color: #bbf7d0; }
    .badge.warning { color: #92400e; background: #fef3c7; border-color: #fde68a; }
    .badge.danger { color: #991b1b; background: #fee2e2; border-color: #fecaca; }
    .badge.info { color: #1e40af; background: #dbeafe; border-color: #bfdbfe; }
    .badge.violet { color: #5b21b6; background: #ede9fe; border-color: #ddd6fe; }
    .badge.dark { color: #111827; background: #f1f5f9; border-color: #cbd5e1; }

    .progress {
      height: 10px;
      width: 100%;
      background: #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 999px;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    .progress > span {
      display: block;
      height: 100%;
      min-width: 2px;
      border-radius: inherit;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--brand), var(--brand-2));
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }

    th, td {
      padding: 11px 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      vertical-align: top;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    th {
      color: #64748b;
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      font-weight: 900;
      background: #f8fafc;
    }

    tr:hover td {
      background: #f8fafc;
    }

    .table-wrap {
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    .muted { color: var(--muted); }
    .small { font-size: 12px; }
    .right { text-align: right; }
    .center { text-align: center; }
    .money { white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

    .company-dot {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-right: 7px;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    .company-logo-small {
      width: 72px;
      height: 42px;
      object-fit: contain;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 4px;
      background: #fff;
      display: inline-block;
      vertical-align: middle;
      margin-right: 8px;
    }

    .canvas-wrap {
      height: 320px;
      position: relative;
    }

    canvas {
      width: 100% !important;
      height: 100% !important;
      display: block;
    }

    .form-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .span-2 { grid-column: span 2; }
    .span-3 { grid-column: span 3; }
    .span-4 { grid-column: span 4; }

    .alert {
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
      background: #eff6ff;
      color: #1e3a8a;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    }

    .alert strong { color: #1d4ed8; }

    .flow {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(8, minmax(120px, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .step {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 14px;
      min-height: 150px;
      position: relative;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    }

    .step:not(:last-child)::after {
      content: "→";
      position: absolute;
      right: -13px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      color: var(--brand);
      font-weight: 900;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .step .num {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), var(--brand-2));
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .step strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 7px;
      color: #0f172a;
    }

    .step p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.42;
    }

    .pill-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 7px 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: #f8fafc;
      color: #475569;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .company-card-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .company-logo-box {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: #fff;
      padding: 12px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
      min-height: 110px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
    }

    .metric-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .mini {
      padding: 11px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--surface-2);
    }

    .mini span {
      display: block;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .mini strong {
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .checklist {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .checklist li {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 24px 1fr;
      gap: 9px;
      color: #475569;
      line-height: 1.45;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .checklist li::before {
      content: "✓";
      width: 22px;
      height: 22px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: #dcfce7;
      color: #166534;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .quote {
      margin: 0;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 21px;
      line-height: 1.35;
      letter-spacing: -.02em;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .exec-summary {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: .92fr 1.08fr;
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .kanban {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(230px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .lane {
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 16px;
      min-height: 180px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .lane h4 {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 12px 13px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      font-size: 13px;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .lead-card {
      margin: 10px;
      padding: 11px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(15,23,42,.04);
    }

    .lead-card strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .lead-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.42;
    }

    .footer-note {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    .daily-target {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 9px 12px;
      background: #fff7ed;
      color: #9a3412;
      border: 1px solid #fed7aa;
      border-radius: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .channel-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .check-tile {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #fff;
      cursor: pointer;
      color: #334155;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .check-tile input {
      width: auto;
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1260px) {
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .logo-strip { justify-content: start; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(100px, 1fr)); }
      .grid.cards { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
      .grid.two, .exec-summary { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .filters { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
      .flow { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(120px, 1fr)); }
      .step:nth-child(4)::after { display: none; }
      .form-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
      .span-3, .span-4 { grid-column: span 2; }
      .metric-row { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .app { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .sidebar { position: relative; height: auto; }
      main { padding: 18px; }
      .toolbar { align-items: stretch; }
      .filters, .actions { width: 100%; }
      .grid.cards, .grid.three, .filters, .form-grid, .metric-row, .company-card-grid, .channel-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .span-2, .span-3, .span-4 { grid-column: span 1; }
      .flow { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .step::after { display: none !important; }
      .logo-strip { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }

    @media print {
      .sidebar, .toolbar, .filters, form, .btn { display: none !important; }
      .app { display: block; }
      main { padding: 0; }
      .section { display: block !important; page-break-after: always; }
      .card { box-shadow: none; border-color: #cbd5e1; }
      body, main { background: #fff !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="app">
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <div class="corporate-logo">
        <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Logotipo corporativo" />
      </div>

      <div class="brand">
        <div class="brand-mark">ERP</div>
        <div>
          <h1>ERP Comercial</h1>
          <small>Ventas + Prospección B2B</small>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="nav">
        <div class="nav-title">Módulos</div>
        <button class="active" data-section="dashboard">Dashboard Ejecutivo <span>01</span></button>
        <button data-section="empresas">Empresas y Metas <span>02</span></button>
        <button data-section="prospeccion">Prospección B2B <span>03</span></button>
        <button data-section="flujo">Flujo del Plan <span>04</span></button>
        <button data-section="captura">Captura Semanal Auto <span>05</span></button>
        <button data-section="leads">CRM Leads <span>06</span></button>
        <button data-section="cotizaciones">Cotizaciones <span>07</span></button>
        <button data-section="vendedores">Vendedores <span>08</span></button>
        <button data-section="ads">SEO / ADS <span>09</span></button>
        <button data-section="config">Configuración <span>10</span></button>
      </div>

      <div class="side-card">
        <strong>Modelo agresivo</strong>
        <p>30 leads y 15 cotizaciones por semana por empresa. Cierre objetivo: 30%. Presupuesto: $3,500 MXN semanales por empresa.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="side-card">
        <strong>Captura automática</strong>
        <p>La captura semanal se calcula desde Prospección B2B, CRM Leads y Cotizaciones. Ya no requiere captura manual duplicada.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="side-card">
        <strong>Base de datos local</strong>
        <p>Versión PHP con SQLite local. La información se guarda en <strong>data/erp_comercial.sqlite</strong>.</p>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <main>
      <div class="hero">
        <div class="title">
          <h2>ERP Comercial</h2>
          <p>Tablero ejecutivo con fondo blanco para controlar el plan agresivo por empresa: prospección diaria, leads, contactos, servicios/productos de interés, cotizaciones con folio, moneda, tipo de cambio, pipeline en MXN y cierre.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="logo-strip">
          <div class="logo-tile"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="SCR Clean Rooms"></div>
          <div class="logo-tile"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Ingeniería Smart"></div>
          <div class="logo-tile"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Maqmen"></div>
          <div class="logo-tile"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Energy Test"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="toolbar">
        <div class="filters">
          <div class="field">
            <label>Empresa</label>
            <select id="filterCompany"></select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label>Periodo</label>
            <select id="filterPeriod">
              <option value="all">Todo el mes</option>
              <option value="semana-1">Semana 1</option>
              <option value="semana-2">Semana 2</option>
              <option value="semana-3">Semana 3</option>
              <option value="semana-4">Semana 4</option>
              <option value="semana-5">Semana 5</option>
            </select>
          </div>
